# Write Text File

## Summary
Host command — write a text file to a realm, such as a module or a card.. Available to
cards and commands via the runtime loader, and to AI assistant rooms as a
tool.

## Example
```ts
import WriteTextFileTool from '@cardstack/boxel-host/commands/write-text-file';

let result = await new WriteTextFileTool(commandContext).execute({
  /* input fields */
} as any);
```
`commandContext` comes from `@context.commandContext` inside any card
format. In an AI room the same tool is invoked by name (action verb: Write).
